  "description": "Legend has it that while some adepti were pursuing the adeptal path, they would wander across mountains and rivers, enjoying various gourmet dishes, using such means to quiet their hearts. Their path would be called the \"Trail of Delicacies\" by those who came after. Now, the Adventurers' Guild has combined this fascinating challenge with the traditions of the Moonchase Festival, placing many treasure chests along the Trail of Delicacies. Follow three such Trails, defeat any foes that lurk around them, and the handsome rewards shall be yours!",
